@startuml system-context
title Blaine — system context
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam wrapWidth 180
skinparam componentBackgroundColor<<proposed>> #FFF2CC

component "Clients\nconversational or programmable" as Clients
component "Personal Agent\nSemantic Triage" as Agent <<decision>>
component "Blaine Core\nprotocol-neutral Task operations" as Core
component "Durable Runtime\nRestate — current implementation" as Runtime <<runtime>>
component "Execution Capabilities\ntools and replaceable workers" as Execution
database "Context / Knowledge\nauthoritative sources and artifacts" as Knowledge
cloud "Cloud\noutside local trust boundary" as Cloud

Clients --> Agent : conversational intent
Clients --> Core : programmable operations
Agent --> Core : TaskSpec (durable intent) / semantic requests
Core --> Runtime : durable work
Core --> Execution : bounded execution
Knowledge --> Core : resolved context and evidence
Execution --> Cloud : allowed external capability

note bottom of Agent
  Semantic interpretation and Work Strategy.
  It is distinct from Blaine Core.
end note

note bottom of Runtime
  Durable identity, state, waits, signals,
  recovery, and acceptance transitions.
end note

note bottom of Knowledge
  Sources remain authoritative; artifacts are durable outputs.
end note

note bottom of Cloud
  External trust boundary.
  Detailed egress is shown elsewhere.
end note
@enduml
